      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777672941172,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Para ello (2,1,1,5) debe cumplir que: \n3(2) - 5(1) - 2(1) + 5 = 0\nLuego:\n6 - 5 - 2 + 5 = 0\n6 - 2 = 0\n4 = 0\nABS\n\n(2,1,1,5) NO pertenece a G",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Para ello (2,1,1,5) debe cumplir que: \n3(2) - 5(1) - 2(1) + 5 = 0\nLuego:\n6 - 5 - 2 + 5 = 0\n6 - 2 = 0\n4 = 0\nABS\n\n(2,1,1,5) NO pertenece a G",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
